ok 1 - empty
ok 2 - no nesting
ok 3 - flattens a nested array
ok 4 - flattens array with just integers present
ok 5 - 5 level nesting
ok 6 - 6 level nesting
ok 7 - null values are omitted from the final result
ok 8 - consecutive null values at the front of the array are omitted from the final result
ok 9 - consecutive null values in the middle of the array are omitted from the final result
ok 10 - 6 level nested array with null values
ok 11 - all values in nested array are null
1..11
